    <div>当前：<span class="val" id="vBeta">3.35</span> TB/s</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ctrl">
    <label for="sPi">矩阵峰值算力 Π <span class="unit">单位：TFLOP/s（=10¹² 次浮点运算/秒）</span></label>
    <input type="range" id="sPi" min="100" max="2000" step="10" aria-describedby="vPi">
    <div>当前：<span class="val" id="vPi">989.4</span> TFLOP/s</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ctrl">
    <label for="sBatch">批内请求数 B <span class="unit">单位：个（无量纲）</span></label>
    <input type="range" id="sBatch" min="1" max="256" step="1" aria-describedby="vBatch">
    <div>当前：<span class="val" id="vBatch">1</span> 个请求共享一次权重读取</div>
  </div>
  <div class="ctrl" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <button class="act" id="resetBtn" type="button">回到书中算例</button>
    <span class="state-note" id="stateNote"></span>
  </div>
</section>

<h2>两个时间下界（同一比例尺）</h2>
<section class="box">
  <div class="bar-head"><span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--read)"></span>权重读取下界 R<sub>W</sub> / β</span><span class="bar-val" id="vReadBar">20.90 ms</span></div>
  <div class="track"><div class="fill read" id="fillRead" style="width:100%"></div></div>
  <div class="bar-head"><span><span class="sw" style="background:var(--comp)"></span>矩阵计算下界 F / Π</span><span class="bar-val" id="vCompBar">0.1415 ms</span></div>
  <div class="track"><div class="fill comp" id="fillComp" style="width:1%"></div></div>
  <p class="verdict" id="verdict" aria-live="polite">这一步由读取决定。</p>
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px">两条条按两者中较大值等比缩放，所以“几乎看不见”本身就是信息：这一项根本不是瓶颈。</p>
</section>

<h2>按公式现算的结果</h2>
<section class="grid cards">
  <div class="card"><div class="k">权重读取量 R<sub>W</sub> = b<sub>W</sub>·N</div><div class="v" id="outRW">70.0 GB</div><div class="n" id="outRWnote">按每参数 1 字节点算的字节数。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">读取下界 R<sub>W</sub> / β</div><div class="v" id="outRead">20.90 ms</div><div class="n">把全部权重从显存搬到计算单元所需的最短时间。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">每步运算量 F = 2BN</div><div class="v" id="outF">140 GFLOPs</div><div class="n">2 来自“一次乘法 + 一次加法”。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">计算下界 F / Π</div><div class="v" id="outComp">0.1415 ms</div><div class="n">按 BF16 稠密矩阵峰值算出的最短时间。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">一步耗时下界 max(F/Π, R<sub>W</sub>/β)</div><div class="v" id="outStep">20.90 ms</div><div class="n">假设读取与计算充分重叠。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">每个输出分摊 T<sub>step</sub> / B</div><div class="v" id="outPer">20.90 ms / token</div><div class="n">整批耗时除以输出数，用来换算吞吐，不是单个请求的响应延迟。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">吞吐上限 B / T<sub>step</sub></div><div class="v" id="outTput">47.9 token/s</div><div class="n">只按这个模型算出的上限。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">转折点 B* = b<sub>W</sub>·Π / (2β)</div><div class="v" id="outBstar">147.7 个请求</div><div class="n" id="outBstarnote">B 超过 B* 后，计算开始追平读取，整批时间随 B 增长。</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">算术强度 I = F / R<sub>W</sub> = 2B / b<sub>W</sub></div><div class="v" id="outI">2.00 FLOP/byte</div><div class="n" id="outInote">机器平衡点 Π / β = 295.3 FLOP/byte；I 小于它，说明读取所需时间更长。</div></div>
</section>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:14px">当前 B 与转折点的关系：<span id="bNote"></span></p>
<p class="muted" style="font-size:14px">容量提示：书中算例用 8 比特方案的 73.73 GB（含量化附加数据）做容量检查，放进一张 80 GB 的 H100 SXM 后只剩约 6.27 GB，装不下 148 条请求的 KV 缓存，所以 B* 只说明算力与带宽的平衡点，实际能开多大还要看容量。<button class="src" data-source-ref="source_ref_c6ab0e94397d4277">书 1.2.3</button><button class="src" data-source-ref="source_ref_6e59d6972c84fe5c">书 1.3.2</button></p>

